1>'s identity, hair, makeup, facial features, and original clothing style. It serves as the style and character anchor.\n<Picture 2> is a reference image defining the starting point of the scene, showing the \"301\" door in a hallway.\n<Picture 3> is a reference image defining the middle portion of the scene, showing the unfurnished room with the barred window.\n<Picture 4> is a reference image defining the final portion of the scene, showing the unfurnished living area with the glass door to the balcony.\n<Audio 1> is the voice-timbre and delivery reference for <Subject 1> (S1), containing a spoken Chinese vocal layer for the house introduction dialogue.\n\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion + reference generation] The target video is generated using multiple reference images to construct a continuous indoor scene tour. <Subject 1> (the elegant woman) is synthesized into the environment defined by <Picture 2>, <Picture 3>, and <Picture 4>, starting at the door and walking through the apartment. <Audio 1> provides the voice reference for <Subject 1>'s spoken Chinese dialogue. The overall visual style is cinematic and realistic, with shallow depth of field, consistent lighting, and the specified camera parameters.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): attribute_transfer - The woman's core facial features, hair style, and makeup from <Picture 1> are preserved, but her outfit is changed from the dark green suit to a summer fashion ensemble as per the user's requirement for \"randomly changing fashion outfits\" while maintaining a \"life-like high-end feel\".\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - The door details from <Picture 2>, the window and room structure from <Picture 3>, and the living area/balcony layout from <Picture 4> are faithfully reconstructed as the continuous environment.\n<Picture 1> (character anchor): fully_preserved - Used solely to define <Subject 1>'s identity, hair, and facial features; not as a specific frame.\n<Picture 2> ([Shot 1] first frame reference): fully_preserved - The composition, door, sign \"301\", and wall tiles establish the starting shot.\n<Picture 3> ([Shot 2] environment reference): fully_preserved - The cement room, window design, and sunlight patterns are integrated into the mid-scene.\n<Picture 4> ([Shot 3] environment reference): fully_preserved - The living area, glass door, and balcony view establish the final scene location.\n<Audio 1>: reference - <Audio 1> provides the vocal timbre, pacing, and delivery style for <Subject 1>'s (S1) dialogue. The original dialogue content from the audio is not directly reused; only the acoustic characteristics are referenced.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a realistic, cinematic style with soft, natural interior lighting, shot with a shallow depth of field as if from a Sony A1 at 85mm f1.4 in 4K UHD resolution. The skin texture is realistic with no plastic AI feel.\n[Shot 1] The scene opens with a medium shot aligned with the composition of <Picture 2>. <Subject 1> (S1), the elegant young woman with long wavy dark brown hair and red lips, now wearing a stylish, well-tailored summer outfit with a coordinated color palette, stands before the closed dark brown wooden door. The \"301\" sign is visible above. The camera holds a static shot as she smiles, then pushes in with small amplitude at normal speed. As she speaks, her voice uses the measured, inviting tone referenced from <Audio 1>: <d>[Chinese]家庭改善置换，是为了全方位提升全家人的居住质感。</d> She reaches for the silver handle.\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.000, as the door opens inward, the camera transitions to follow her, trucking right with medium amplitude at normal speed into the unfurnished room. The environment now matches <Picture 3>: rough gray cement walls and floor, a white ceiling, and the window with bars and grille letting in bright sunlight that casts shadows on the left wall. <Subject 1> (S1) gestures around the empty space while continuing her introduction, her voice maintaining the referenced timbre: <d>[Chinese]东城区光大景湖蓝郡改善四房，一百三十八平通透格局，</d> The camera pans left smoothly, following her movement and showcasing the room's dimensions.\n[Shot 3] At 00:10.000, the shot cuts to a close-up of <Subject 1> (S1) from the waist up, her face and upper body in sharp focus against the blurred cement background. She maintains her elegant demeanor and consistent facial features. She looks into the camera and delivers the next line with a clear, persuasive tone, referencing <Audio 1>: <d>[Chinese]一百三十九万置业，单价一万</d> A slight smile plays on her red lips.\n[Shot 4] At 00:13.000, the camera pulls out with small amplitude at slow speed to a medium shot as she turns and walks towards the far end of the space. The camera follows her in a tracking shot. The background now reveals the area from <Picture 4>: the glass sliding door with the balcony, green plants, and railings visible outside. The natural light from the glass door illuminates the scene. <Subject 1> (S1) gestures towards the balcony view and concludes her introduction: <d>[Chinese]感兴趣的朋友评论区扣6，我带你实地看房。</d> She turns back to the camera with a welcoming smile as the video ends. Her facial features, hair, and overall appearance remain unchanged throughout all shots. No subtitles, text overlay, or watermarks appear at any point.\n\noverall_soundscape: The ambient sound features indoor room tone that transitions from a quiet hallway to a more open, empty space with slight echo. Clear, sharp footsteps on the hard floor are heard as the woman walks. The door opens with a soft click and creak.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A soft, upbeat, and modern electronic track with a light rhythm and melodic synth elements, creating an inviting and aspirational atmosphere, fades in at the start and continues steadily underneath the dialogue before gently fading out at the end."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value